{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_58","type":"agent_message","text":"The first checks caught two important problems: the collision threshold rejected takeoff, and bloom hid the procedural aircraft in WebGL. Takeoff is corrected, and I’ve disabled bloom for the native rendering path. The screenshots now show the bomber, airfield, route map, and crew portrait. I’m tuning flak next—the original danger radius gave a heavy aircraft too little room to evade.\n"}}
